#pragma once

/*
 * The string cipher of BO4's changelist 3310077 zones (mp_urban_alt; wz_escape and zm_red before their .fd), recovered
 * from those zones' string lists: statistics, then the patched zones' strings as a dictionary (17683 of 17816 strings
 * are known words; long names may have a wrong tail). A string is [type 0x80..0xBF][length + 1][length bytes]: byte i
 * is ROTL(p, r) ^ k with (r, k) of its type and position, or k itself where that would be 0 (then p = ROTR(k, r)).
 * An entry is r << 8 | k, 0xFFFF where no string of the type was that long (22 types are never used).
 */
